@startuml
actor "Library \n & Application Developer" as APP_DEV order 10 #LightGreen 
actor "Application Publisher" as APP_PUB order 10 #LightGreen 
actor "System/Infra\n Operator" as INFRA_OP order 20 #LightGreen 
actor "Network\n Operator" as NET_OP order 30 #LightGreen 
actor "CorDapp\n User" as CORDAPP_USER order 35 #LightPink
'actor "VNode\n Operator" as VNODE_OP order 1 #LightPink 
actor "VNode\n Operator\n**Member1**" as Member1 order 1 #LightPink
actor "VNode\n Operator\n**Other active members**" as Member2 order 1 #LightPink
actor "Cluster\n Operator" as CLUSTER_OP order 12 #LightYellow 

participant "\nMGM\n Cluster\n" as MGM order 70 #LightGreen 
participant "\nMember\n Cluster\n" as MEMBER order 32 #LightCoral 
participant "\nNotary\n Cluster\n" as NOTARY order 80 #LightGreen
participant "\nPeer\n Cluster\n" as PEER order 90 #red
participant "Certificate Authority \n +OSCP" as CA order 100
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center


hide footbox


skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
hide unlinked

    
title Cordapp Network, System context diagram 
group Cordapp Development
NET_OP -> MGM++: Setup trust root certificate
'hnote over NET_OP, MGM: <font color=red>Not in place</font> 
MGM --> NET_OP--: return

APP_DEV -> APP_DEV++: Write CPK

APP_DEV -> APP_DEV: self sign test CPI
APP_DEV -> APP_DEV--: Tests CPI
note right  #FFAA11: Auth signed \n cert needed?

APP_DEV -> APP_DEV ++: Create certificates and keys
  
APP_DEV -> NET_OP --: <font color=blue><b>DF_CPK_TRUSTED_CRED\nSends PubKey/Cer
deactivate APP_DEV
activate NET_OP
NET_OP -> MGM: <font color=blue><b>DF_CONF_CPI_CPB_CPK_VER_CRED\nSet trusted credentials
activate MGM
MGM --> NET_OP : return
deactivate MGM
deactivate NET_OP
APP_DEV -> APP_DEV : Sign CPK
activate APP_DEV
deactivate APP_DEV
APP_DEV -> APP_PUB : Send CPK (dataflow TBD, maybe out of scope)
note right  #FFAA11: Deferred Mitigation

APP_PUB -> APP_PUB ++: Write CPB
note right  #FFAA11: Internal CPK signatures are not verified \n (may fail later on, medium DoS)



APP_PUB -> APP_PUB : Self sign test CPI
APP_PUB -> APP_PUB --: Tests CPI

APP_PUB -> APP_PUB ++: Create certificates and keys
note left  #FFAA11: Auth signed \n cert needed?

deactivate APP_PUB

APP_PUB -> NET_OP : <font color=blue><b>DF_CPK_TRUSTED_CRED\nSends PubKey/Cer
activate NET_OP
NET_OP -> MGM ++: <font color=blue><b>DF_CONF_CPI_CPB_CPK_VER_CRED\nSetTrustedCredentials()

MGM --> NET_OP -- : return
deactivate NET_OP
end
group CPI signing and creation
APP_PUB -> NET_OP : <font color=blue><b>DF_CPB_AQUISITION
activate NET_OP
NET_OP -> MGM: <font color=blue><b>DF_CPB_Verify\nVerifyCPB API 
activate MGM
MGM -> CA : Verify with root of trust
activate CA
CA --> MGM: return
deactivate CA
MGM -> MGM : check authorized x500 names \n configured in DF_CONF_CPI_CPB_CPK_VER_CRED
note over NET_OP, MGM #FFAA11: Network operator should use a specific API \n with configured creds in the cluster to verify and sign, \n not use previously aquired secrets (TBC) 
MGM --> NET_OP --: return CPB Verified OK


NET_OP -> NET_OP ++--: Add Network policy + sign CPI \n (GroupPolicy.json)
note right #FFAA11: This may be performed via \n API not a ritual HSM etc  
deactivate NET_OP
end
group CPI installation
MGM -> CLUSTER_OP : CPI distribution (TBD)

MEMBER -> MGM ++: delegate CPI verification
MGM --> MEMBER --: return
note over MEMBER, MGM #FFAA11: Delegate verification VS Verify \nby ... credentials (pubKeys of Cordap devs) 
CLUSTER_OP -> MEMBER ++: post_cpi

MEMBER --> CLUSTER_OP --: return
end
@enduml